# axiom explain, every code and every spelling.
# Materialized from the Rust compiler at commit 1041f11 on 2026-08-08,
# which is the last moment its answers could be recorded. self_host/explain.ax
# was GENERATED from these bytes; this file is what keeps them from drifting.
